WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:42.830
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.730 --> 00:00:50.200
With our memories fading

00:00:50.740 --> 00:00:57.280
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:04.180
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:31.310 --> 00:01:35.210
Defeating a scrub in a duel isn't satisfying.

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:37.840
My Battle City is over.

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:42.950
But Yugi!  You said a friend's card brought you victory!

00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:47.150
Then I'll give you this card to defeat Ra!

00:01:47.150 --> 00:01:48.320
There are no miracles!

00:01:48.320 --> 00:01:50.070
There is no power of friendship!

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:52.710
Your defeat will prove that!

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.320
Take this, Yugi!

00:01:56.060 --> 00:02:02.070
Final Match  Yugi vs Marik

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:07.910
This card is Fiend's Sanctuary.

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:14.000
Brother, why did you give that card to Yugi?

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:16.140
Kaiba...

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:18.660
Fiend's Sanctuary.

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:24.880
That spell card is the only card that can stop Marik's One Turn Kill.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:29.510
But you don't even know the existence of Ra's secret ability.

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:33.710
Can you figure out a way to stop it?

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:37.540
You only have a 20% chance in this game!

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:41.970
Yugi!  You said the power of your friends brought you victory!

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:46.660
But in a battle, others are nothing but a burden!

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:49.640
That card will teach you that!

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:51.740
What does he mean?

00:02:51.740 --> 00:02:54.730
Kaiba gave Yugi a card?

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:56.750
Is he up to something?

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:58.130
I'm suspicious.

00:02:58.130 --> 00:02:59.510
Be careful, Yugi!

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:01.090
He's up to something!

00:03:01.370 --> 00:03:05.760
Of course, it's your decision whether to put that card in your deck.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:15.580
Kaiba.  I'll trust you!

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.540
And I will defeat Marik!

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:25.250
We will now begin the final match of the Battle City Tournament!

00:03:25.250 --> 00:03:28.050
Marik Ishtar vs Yugi Muto!

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:30.990
Duel, standby!

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:34.950
Yugi, I don't know what card Kaiba gave you.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:36.700
But it's worthless.

00:03:36.700 --> 00:03:39.430
It won't do anything against Ra.

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:45.200
Marik, I'll defeat the evil soul inside you in this duel!

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:50.110
Really?  Go ahead and try!

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:50.920
Yugi!

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:52.530
You must win!

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:53.870
We're counting on you, Yugi!

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:58.370
But you need three tributes to summon a God.

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:01.100
That's pretty tough for Yugi.

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:02.440
What do you mean?

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:08.720
Yugi has two God Cards: Slifer the Sky Dragon and Obelisk the Tormentor.

00:04:08.940 --> 00:04:14.210
But even if it's only for one turn, Marik can use Monster Reborn to Special Summon Ra.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.410
I activate a spell card!

00:04:16.410 --> 00:04:17.730
Monster Reborn!

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:23.220
Bear witness to God!

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:26.900
I summon The Winged Dragon of Ra from my graveyard!

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.480
The Winged Dragon of Ra's final form!

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:40.120
God Phoenix!

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:46.230
In my duel, Ra's effect instantly destroyed my monsters.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:59.330
And Ra supposedly has an even more terrifying effect.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:00.260
Jonouchi...

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:05.920
Kaiba said he deciphered that effect.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.170
The card he gave Yugi...

00:05:09.170 --> 00:05:12.020
Was it the key card to defeat Ra?

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:15.660
Duelists, cut and shuffle each others' decks!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.170
Shuffle well.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:26.310
And hope that Ra goes to the bottom of the deck.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:27.800
Seto...

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:32.420
Ishizu.  I helped him, as you wished.

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:36.780
But only to prove that miracles won't occur.

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:41.600
The tablet means nothing to me. It's only an artifact.

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:48.660
Civilization is built through time upon the ashes of countless people.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:53.560
A 3,000 year-old mummy has nothing to do with me.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.660
You're wrong.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:59.770
Even if civilization perishes, a person's soul and will are eternal.

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:07.710
If Yugi loses and fails to save your brother, you'll sink into eternal despair.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.710
I believe in Yugi.

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:16.350
I believe friendship will defeat a God controlled by evil.

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:19.550
Miracles don't exist!

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:21.460
Friendship is powerless!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:24.990
Yugi, your defeat will prove that!

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:26.410
Here you go.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:31.980
I wonder if Ra is at the bottom of my deck.

00:06:33.320 --> 00:06:36.480
Marik, the deck will give you the answer.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.520
With your defeat!

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:42.570
Keep talking!

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:47.780
Keep talking so you won't have any regrets for leaving anything unsaid.

00:06:49.210 --> 00:06:50.720
Win, Yugi!

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:53.500
You don't need to be scared of Ra!

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.060
Beat Marik!

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:56.530
Please, Yugi.

00:06:56.530 --> 00:06:58.490
Save Mai!

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:03.860
Battle City's final match.

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:05.660
The Ishtars' destiny-

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:10.440
No.  Everyone's destiny rests on you, Yugi.

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:15.680
Please defeat Marik's evil and obtain the key to your memories.

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:19.100
And please save Marik.

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.480
Please!

00:07:26.180 --> 00:07:28.040
Start the duel!

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:34.400
I go first.

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:35.600
Here I go!

00:07:37.740 --> 00:07:39.440
Not again!

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:42.890
Darkness is covering the field.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.010
A Shadow Game...

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:53.170
Yugi, I've prepared the ultimate Shadow Game for our fight.

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:57.840
Darkness covers everything, and the gates of hell open.

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:20.180
I'll show you something fun.

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.540
Mai!

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:33.200
Can you see the darkness devouring her?

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:36.180
Her life is gradually ending.

00:08:40.430 --> 00:08:41.380
Mai!

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.060
Today's a banquet of darkness.

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:47.800
Let's feast on our sacrifices.

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:48.970
What?

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:53.910
I told you that I'll have an nice plan for our duel.

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:59.310
I'll now show you the greatest sacrifice!

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:05.520
Partner?

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.220
What?

00:09:07.220 --> 00:09:08.310
Partner!

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:10.170
My other self!

00:09:11.640 --> 00:09:14.350
You can see him, right?

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:18.240
A fresh sacrifice has been brought to the table.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:21.270
Marik!  What's the meaning of this?

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:23.670
This is who I'm sacrificing.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:27.400
The other Marik!

00:09:27.640 --> 00:09:32.560
Victory and defeat are the boundary between pleasure and pain.

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:34.200
What do you mean?

00:09:34.860 --> 00:09:36.550
Don't get impatient.

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:39.600
You'll understand soon enough.

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:41.820
My turn!  I draw!

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.500
I summon Vampiric Leech!

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:48.000
Attack him!

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:48.870
What?

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:57.220
Vampiric Leech can attack on the first turn.

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:06.380
The monster's attack deals you pain.

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:07.550
And look.

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:12.320
Partner!

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:18.650
For every life point you lose, the darkness devours the sacrifice.

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:22.000
What?

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:26.430
When your life points drop to 0, the sacrifice will be completely devoured.

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:30.450
And you'll suffer ultimate pain as you're buried in the darkness.

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:33.510
Those are the rules of this Shadow Game, Yugi.

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:35.020
How dare you!

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:38.280
This is nice.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.220
Writhe in pain.

00:10:40.220 --> 00:10:43.020
It gives me such pleasure!

00:10:45.570 --> 00:10:50.400
If my life points drop to 0, my partner will be lost to the darkness.

00:10:52.370 --> 00:10:57.140
But if I defeat Marik, the other Marik will be sacrificed.

00:10:57.140 --> 00:10:58.630
What should I do?

00:10:59.020 --> 00:11:03.400
Yugi, we were both chosen by the Millennium Items.

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:07.550
This is a fair fight where the loser vanishes.

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:09.040
Right?

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:13.650
If I drag your vessel into the darkness, you will vanish too.

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:19.260
But if the darkness takes my sacrifice, I won't vanish.

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:23.820
Fight, my other self!

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:31.200
If this battle leads to what you've been searching for, I'll fight with you!

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.630
Partner!

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:37.480
You must defeat Marik's evil and win your light!

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:44.380
The Millennium Item chose me so I can give you strength!

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:47.860
Right.  Thank you, partner.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:51.460
Everything lies ahead of this battle.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:55.020
By defeating his dark side, I believe there's a way...

00:11:55.020 --> 00:12:02.910
...to save Marik, my partner and those who lost their Shadow Games, like Mai and Bakura.

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:05.830
I'll find out how in this battle!

00:12:08.930 --> 00:12:13.570
I promise to save you both!

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:35.710
Damn!  What kind of Shadow Game is this?

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:39.200
Yugi, don't get hurt in this dangerous game.

00:12:39.200 --> 00:12:41.300
Please don't lose!

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:45.400
My turn isn't over yet.

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:49.510
Vampiric Leech has another effect.

00:12:49.720 --> 00:12:54.250
By discarding a card, it ends this turn in defense position.

00:12:54.480 --> 00:12:58.420
It has another effect in addition to its quick attack!

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:01.240
Which card shall I discard?

00:13:01.650 --> 00:13:03.160
I choose this one.

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:11.870
Do you know how scary it is when The Winged Dragon of Ra is in my graveyard?

00:13:12.300 --> 00:13:17.300
If I get that card, you'll lose instantly.

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:20.040
What did he place in his graveyard?

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:21.040
Can it be?

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:23.480
Vampiric Leech switches to defense position.

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:26.140
And I set a card.

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:27.780
I end my turn.

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:30.780
Marik used a clever strategy.

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:35.870
If he used Vampiric Leech's effect to place Ra in the graveyard...

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:39.390
His Monster Reborn combo will cause a One Turn Kill.

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:41.760
My turn!  I draw!

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.310
I summon this monster!

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.170
Queen's Knight!

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:54.880
King, Queen, Jack...

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:58.280
She's one of three knights used to summon a God quickly.

00:13:58.280 --> 00:14:00.710
But it's too late!

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:03.160
Attack Vampiric Leech!

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:06.450
Queen's Saber Crush!

00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:13.810
Vampiric Leech was in defense position, so I don't lose life points.  Too bad!

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:15.880
I set two cards.

00:14:17.060 --> 00:14:18.470
I end my turn!

00:14:20.780 --> 00:14:22.450
My turn.

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.340
I draw.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:30.720
Did he really place Ra in his graveyard?

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:34.350
That means if he draws Monster Reborn...

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:39.020
I drew a great card.

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:46.020
I'll summon a monster before I activate this card.

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:48.160
I summon Juragedo!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:53.630
Juragedo, kill Queen's Knight!

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:55.770
Queen's Knight is destroyed!

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:02.510
Partner!

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:05.700
I'm still okay!

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:08.360
I set two cards.

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:09.620
I end my turn.

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:12.050
My turn!  I draw!

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:17.170
I activate my trap card!

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:18.770
Left Arm Offering!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:19.640
What?

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:27.860
By sending my entire hand to the graveyard, I can draw one spell card from my deck.

00:15:30.300 --> 00:15:33.890
I choose Monster Reborn.

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:35.960
I flip over my set card!

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:37.400
Exchange!

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:42.060
We exchange a card in our hands.

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:43.660
Pick one!

00:15:44.620 --> 00:15:47.290
I take your Monster Reborn!

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:49.930
All right!

00:15:49.930 --> 00:15:51.390
Way to go, Yugi!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:03.600
Even though he lost Monster Reborn, Marik is still confident.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.660
Enjoy it while you can.

00:16:07.660 --> 00:16:09.680
As long as I have this set card...

00:16:09.980 --> 00:16:12.080
I activate Monster Reborn!

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:14.150
I Special Summon Queen's Knight!

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:16.960
Then I summon King's Knight!

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:28.370
When King and Queen are on the field, I can Special Summon this from my deck!

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:32.400
Jack's Knight!

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:34.730
King!

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:35.950
Queen!

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:36.910
Jack!

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:39.510
I summoned the three face card knights!

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:46.880
What a clever move with my Monster Reborn!

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:51.820
If I can get my God Card, I can defeat Marik!

00:16:52.080 --> 00:16:56.400
Nice!  Yugi is one step away from summoning his God!

00:16:56.400 --> 00:17:00.690
And Marik can't use Monster Reborn to summon his God!

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:04.720
But Marik still has a set card on his field.

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:06.200
He has to be careful.

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:09.200
Marik only has De-Fusion in his hand.

00:17:09.220 --> 00:17:10.870
Now's my chance to attack!

00:17:11.610 --> 00:17:15.720
But he's not nervous at all.

00:17:16.700 --> 00:17:19.690
You don't have a God Card in your hand.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:25.340
What's wrong?  Don't be scared, Yugi.

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:26.750
Attack me!

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:31.420
When you attack, you'll fall prey to my God!

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:37.300
His set card must be a terrifying trap.

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:40.770
I end my turn.

00:17:42.280 --> 00:17:45.700
Your apprehension saved you for one turn.

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:47.860
What's wrong with Yugi?

00:17:47.860 --> 00:17:52.200
If he attacked, he could've dealt Marik a lot of damage.

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.970
I get it.

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:58.110
Yugi's dueling instincts wouldn't let him attack.

00:17:58.110 --> 00:17:59.620
What do you mean?

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.770
Yugi may look like he has the advantage.

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:06.970
But Marik is confident.  He's up to something.

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:09.660
My turn.  I draw.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:13.030
I set a card.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:17.910
Yugi, you don't have a God in your hand.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:24.140
It's pitiful to see you longing for a God Card during every turn's Draw Phase.

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:28.620
And if the God Card happens to be Slifer the Sky Dragon...

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:32.000
...the fewer cards in your hand, the weaker it is.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:35.220
So I have a present for you.

00:18:36.600 --> 00:18:39.290
I activate a spell card from my hand!

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:41.060
Card of Sanctity!

00:18:41.330 --> 00:18:42.400
What?

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:46.750
We both draw until we have six cards in our hands.

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:50.440
He's letting me have six cards in my hand?

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:57.080
Restock your hand!  And hope that you get a God!

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:00.560
You're going to regret this, Marik.

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:08.360
Well?  Did you draw a God Card?

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:14.130
I switch Juragedo to defense position and end my turn.

00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:20.130
Battle City rules only allow one Monster Reborn per deck.

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:23.570
But if he has that terrifying card...

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:26.280
My turn!  I draw!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:29.800
I now have seven cards in my hand.

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:34.610
If I summon Slifer, it'll have 6000 attack points.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:36.280
Is it coming?

00:19:36.760 --> 00:19:39.520
I tribute my three Knights!

00:19:40.250 --> 00:19:43.750
I summon Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:19:59.300 --> 00:20:01.850
You've arrived, Slifer!

00:20:01.850 --> 00:20:02.970
It's here!

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:06.520
Yugi's God Card, Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:20:06.520 --> 00:20:09.250
And it has 6000 attack points!  Wow!

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:14.130
No matter what he has planned, Marik is going to lose!

00:20:17.460 --> 00:20:18.760
Yugi...

00:20:20.690 --> 00:20:23.360
Here I go!  Slifer attacks!

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:25.600
Thunder Force!

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:32.140
I'll reveal Ra's power!

00:20:32.140 --> 00:20:34.070
I activate my spell card!

00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:36.010
Dark Spell Regeneration!

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:37.040
What?

00:20:37.580 --> 00:20:39.640
Brother, what is that?

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:41.440
Dark Spell Regeneration.

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:44.340
It activates when the opponent's monster attacks.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:47.390
It lets him use a spell card in the graveyard.

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:48.990
So Marik is going to...

00:20:49.300 --> 00:20:51.790
Activate Monster Reborn.

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:56.330
Yugi!  I activate Monster Reborn from the graveyard!

00:20:56.330 --> 00:21:01.200
Ra who sleeps in the earth, resurrect as a phoenix!

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:09.170
Ra!  Resurrect from the earth and soar to the heavens as the fiery phoenix!

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:22.990
God Phoenix absorbed Slifer's Thunder Force!

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:27.020
My God is immortal this turn.

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:29.510
No attack can harm it!

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:33.930
God Phoenix!

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:36.070
That's what defeated me.

00:21:36.470 --> 00:21:42.010
Yugi!  I'll burn you and Slifer with scorching flames!

00:21:57.420 --> 00:22:02.260
Marik used Monster Reborn to finally bring out The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:05.770
Attacks by Yugi's Slifer don't work.

00:22:05.770 --> 00:22:09.630
And God Phoenix's effect destroys it!

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:14.270
Marik says he's going to summon Ra again next turn.

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:16.950
Yugi, isn't there anything you can do?

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:20.280
Huh?  He drew and set a card without looking at it!

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:23.280
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Fiend's Sanctuary Activates!

00:22:23.280 --> 00:22:24.640
Duel, standby!

00:22:32.340 --> 00:22:41.250
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:49.590
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:51.320 --> 00:23:00.750
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:23:01.370 --> 00:23:10.270
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:23:10.840 --> 00:23:19.300
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:24.810
I'll live feeling them

00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:29.990
For me to be me

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:38.450
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:39.130 --> 00:23:44.090
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:44.610 --> 00:23:53.750
We'll both understand that someday
